{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26158","headline":"观灯 · 张萧远","name":"观灯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十万人家火烛光，门门开处见红妆。\n歌钟喧夜更漏暗，罗绮满街尘土香。\n星宿别从天畔出，莲花不向水中芳。\n宝钗骤马多遗落，依旧明朝在路傍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张萧远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26158.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26158","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}